    {
      "order": 1,
      "file": "hsk2_sc011_line_001.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "今天回家以后，我什么都不想做。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "file": "hsk2_sc011_line_002.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "听起来你真的很累。今天工作很忙吗？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "file": "hsk2_sc011_line_003.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "下午一直没停，回来的路上我都想睡觉。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "file": "hsk2_sc011_line_004.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "那今晚别安排太多事情。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "file": "hsk2_sc011_line_005.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我本来还想学习半个小时中文。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "file": "hsk2_sc011_line_006.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "可以少学一点儿，十分钟也可以。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "file": "hsk2_sc011_line_007.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我怕今天不学，明天也不想学。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "file": "hsk2_sc011_line_008.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "休息一天不会影响你的习惯。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "file": "hsk2_sc011_line_009.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "你说得对。我最近好像总是把时间排得太满。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "file": "hsk2_sc011_line_010.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "工作、学习、运动都重要，但是也要有空时间。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "file": "hsk2_sc011_line_011.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我晚上经常觉得时间不够。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "file": "hsk2_sc011_line_012.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "因为你想一天做太多事。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "file": "hsk2_sc011_line_013.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "那今天只吃饭、洗澡，然后早点儿睡。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "file": "hsk2_sc011_line_014.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "很好。明天有精神以后再学习。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "file": "hsk2_sc011_line_015.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "其实听你这么说，我已经轻松一点儿了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "file": "hsk2_sc011_line_016.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "有时候休息也是计划的一部分。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "file": "hsk2_sc011_line_017.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "这句话我应该记下来。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "file": "hsk2_sc011_line_018.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "先别记了，今天就好好休息吧。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
